{
  "message": "Starting the Parcelly–Spokes integration. I've analyzed Parcelly's API (parcel/pallet shipments, idempotency, signed webhooks, Polish validation rules) and Spokes' needs (webhook to /orders/{id}/pay, order ID format, signature docs, refund/cancellation info). Key mismatches: phone format (+48XXXXXXXXX vs consumer's varied examples), idempotency key handling, status mapping (CREATED/COLLECTED/IN_TRANSIT/DELIVERED/RETURNED → Spokes order statuses), and whether Spokes expects Parcelly to call their payment endpoint (which seems like a misunderstanding—Parcelly sends shipment status changes). I'll draft schemas, operations, webhooks, secrets, decisions, and provider scenarios. Three business choices need your input.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/secrets/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "partner_api_key",
        "description": "Bearer token of the partner (Spokes) for authenticating to Parcelly API"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/secrets/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "webhook_secret",
        "description": "HMAC-SHA256 secret for signing webhook payloads sent from Parcelly to Spokes"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/parcel",
      "value": "A shipment up to 25 000 g with size A/B/C derived from weight"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/pallet",
      "value": "A shipment 25 001–1 000 000 g on a EUR pallet"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/reference",
      "value": "Spokes' order identifier (e.g. ORD-1001) passed as 'reference' in shipment creation and used for idempotency"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/groszy",
      "value": "1/100 PLN; all prices are integers in groszy"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/CreateParcelRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "reference",
          "receiver",
          "parcel"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "reference": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "flat": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "nullable": true
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "PL"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "parcel": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "size"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 25000
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "B",
                  "C"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/CreatePalletRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "reference",
          "receiver",
          "pallet"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "reference": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "flat": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "nullable": true
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "PL"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "pallet": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "pallet_type"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 25001,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              "pallet_type": {
                "type": "string",
                "const": "EUR"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/Shipment",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "service",
          "partnerId",
          "reference",
          "status",
          "trackingNumber",
          "priceGr",
          "receiver",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^shp_\\d+$"
          },
          "service": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "parcel",
              "pallet"
            ]
          },
          "partnerId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reference": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CREATED",
              "COLLECTED",
              "IN_TRANSIT",
              "DELIVERED",
              "RETURNED"
            ]
          },
          "trackingNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^PCL\\d+PL$"
          },
          "priceGr": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "flat": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "nullable": true
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "parcel": {
            "type": "object",
            "nullable": true,
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "size"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "pallet": {
            "type": "object",
            "nullable": true,
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "pallet_type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "pallet_type": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/Error",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "INVALID_JSON",
              "INVALID_REQUEST",
              "INVALID_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_PHONE",
              "INVALID_POSTCODE",
              "WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
              "SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH",
              "POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH",
              "PALLET_WEIGHT_OUT_OF_RANGE",
              "REFERENCE_REQUIRED",
              "SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/ShipmentStatusChanged",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "event",
          "shipment_id",
          "reference",
          "status",
          "occurred_at"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "event": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "shipment.status_changed"
          },
          "shipment_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reference": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CREATED",
              "COLLECTED",
              "IN_TRANSIT",
              "DELIVERED",
              "RETURNED"
            ]
          },
          "occurred_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/WebhookConfig",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "secret"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "secret": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/create_parcel",
      "value": {
        "description": "Create a new parcel shipment (up to 25 kg). Idempotency-Key header prevents duplicate charges.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/shipments",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            },
            "Idempotency-Key": {
              "required": false,
              "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/CreateParcelRequest"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Shipment"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 201,
          "body": {
            "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
            "service": "parcel",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL{{seq}}PL",
            "priceGr": 1299,
            "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
            "parcel": "{{request.body.parcel}}",
            "pallet": null,
            "createdAt": "{{now}}",
            "updatedAt": "{{now}}"
          },
          "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/create_pallet",
      "value": {
        "description": "Create a new pallet shipment (25 001–1 000 000 g). Body uses 'pallet' object instead of 'parcel'.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/pallets",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            },
            "Idempotency-Key": {
              "required": false,
              "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/CreatePalletRequest"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Shipment"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 201,
          "body": {
            "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
            "service": "pallet",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL{{seq}}PL",
            "priceGr": 27000,
            "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
            "parcel": null,
            "pallet": "{{request.body.pallet}}",
            "createdAt": "{{now}}",
            "updatedAt": "{{now}}"
          },
          "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_shipment_by_reference",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve the most recent shipment for a given reference (partner-scoped).",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/shipments",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "body": null
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Shipment"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "id": "shp_1",
            "service": "parcel",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "{{request.query.reference}}",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL1PL",
            "priceGr": 1299,
            "receiver": {
              "name": "Jan Kowalski",
              "phone": "+48600100200",
              "address": {
                "street": "Długa",
                "building": "5",
                "flat": "3",
                "postcode": "00-001",
                "city": "Warszawa",
                "country": "PL"
              }
            },
            "parcel": {
              "weight_g": 1200,
              "size": "A"
            },
            "pallet": null,
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_shipment_by_id",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve a specific shipment by ID (partner-scoped).",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/shipments/{id}",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "body": null
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Shipment"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "id": "{{request.path.id}}",
            "service": "parcel",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "ORD-1001",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL1PL",
            "priceGr": 1299,
            "receiver": {
              "name": "Jan Kowalski",
              "phone": "+48600100200",
              "address": {
                "street": "Długa",
                "building": "5",
                "flat": "3",
                "postcode": "00-001",
                "city": "Warszawa",
                "country": "PL"
              }
            },
            "parcel": {
              "weight_g": 1200,
              "size": "A"
            },
            "pallet": null,
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/register_webhook",
      "value": {
        "description": "Register or replace the partner's webhook endpoint. Parcelly will POST signed events to this URL.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/webhooks",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookConfig"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookConfig"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "url": "{{request.body.url}}",
            "secret": "{{request.body.secret}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_webhook",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve the currently registered webhook URL for the partner.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/webhooks",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "body": null
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookConfig"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "url": "https://shop.example.com/parcelly/webhook",
            "secret": "whsec_test_secret"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/webhooks/shipment_status_changed",
      "value": {
        "description": "Parcelly posts this event when a shipment's status changes. Signed with HMAC-SHA256.",
        "direction": "provider_to_consumer",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "${CONSUMER_WEBHOOK_URL}",
          "headers": {
            "X-Signature": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^sha256=[0-9a-f]{64}$"
            },
            "Content-Type": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^application/json$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentStatusChanged"
          }
        },
        "signature": {
          "algorithm": "hmac-sha256",
          "header": "X-Signature",
          "format": "sha256={hex}",
          "over": "raw_body",
          "secret": "webhook_secret"
        },
        "consumer_responses": {
          "valid_signature": 200,
          "invalid_signature": 401
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/semantic_mappings/parcelly_status_to_spokes_status",
      "value": {
        "CREATED": "pending",
        "COLLECTED": "collected",
        "IN_TRANSIT": "in_transit",
        "DELIVERED": "delivered",
        "RETURNED": "returned"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D1",
        "text": "Phone numbers must match ^\\+48\\d{9}$ exactly. Consumer examples include '600 100 200', '0048 600-100-200', '+48500200300' — only '+48600100200' matches. Provider rejects others with 422 INVALID_PHONE. Who normalizes?",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D2",
        "text": "Idempotency-Key header is optional (max 255 chars, blank treated as missing). If provided, duplicate keys return the original shipment. Consumer brief doesn't mention idempotency. Should Spokes always send it (using reference as key) or only on retries?",
        "owner": "consumer"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D3",
        "text": "Parcelly statuses (CREATED, COLLECTED, IN_TRANSIT, DELIVERED, RETURNED) map to Spokes order statuses via semantic_mappings. Spokes uses pending/paid/shipped/delivered/cancelled. Is the mapping CREATED→pending, COLLECTED→collected, IN_TRANSIT→in_transit, DELIVERED→delivered, RETURNED→returned acceptable, or does Spokes need different names?",
        "owner": "consumer"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D4",
        "text": "Spokes' open needs mention a webhook to POST /orders/{id}/pay upon successful payment. Parcelly sends shipment.status_changed events, not payment confirmations. Clarify: does Spokes expect Parcelly to call their payment endpoint, or will Spokes consume shipment.status_changed and update order status themselves?",
        "owner": "consumer"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D5",
        "text": "Parcelly validates postcode-city match using a prefix map (first two digits → city). Consumer examples use '00-001' with 'Warszawa'. Provider rejects mismatches with 422 POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH. Is the prefix map fixed and shared, or does Spokes need to provide/maintain it?",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/scenarios/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "P1",
        "title": "Valid parcel shipment is created and idempotency key returns same shipment",
        "side": "provider",
        "covers": [
          "create_parcel"
